{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":13,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":873,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1886821,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277535,"Name":"atyson03","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277535.jpg?_r=1397079819","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1424353822,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":43,"Preview":{"Id":1898258,"PostDate":1433864472,"PostContent":"Take a look at Tygrlilly's thread. She use real touch (Bloom Bridals I think it was) and I don't...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.233.132.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78815,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by deecol, 18 May 2015 - 06:03 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1431972238,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a49748b45939a9cbc7f304bbb76f3be","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I found these beautiful calla lilies this past weekend at Michael&#039;s. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m not sure what they are made from but they feel so real and look amazing!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They were reg $5.99 a flower, reduced to $2.39 and my best friend got me 15% off with her teacher&#039;s discount. &amp;nbsp;So 15 flowers cost me $35 in total.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896550,"PostDate":1431971305,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I found these beautiful calla lilies this past weekend at Michael's. \u00a0I'm not sure what they are made from but they feel so real and look amazing!<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1896550]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-281751-0-59210800-1431985589.jpg\" title=\"Picture1.jpg - Size: 17.38KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-281751-0-59210800-1431985589.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Picture1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>They were reg $5.99 a flower, reduced to $2.39 and my best friend got me 15% off with her teacher's discount. \u00a0So 15 flowers cost me $35 in total.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421428169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1427826222","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.195.165.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78815,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5dd99c76c731698257e103283b24cf79","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Did any ladies have any issues getting Real Touch flowers into Mexico?&amp;nbsp; I was considering only doing my bouquet and not doing them for the brides but now I&#039;m not so sure.&amp;nbsp; Did they travel well and did you have any issues at customs?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898192,"PostDate":1433848680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Did any ladies have any issues getting Real Touch flowers into Mexico?\u00a0 I was considering only doing my bouquet and not doing them for the brides but now I'm not so sure.\u00a0 Did they travel well and did you have any issues at customs?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andreapurcell1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.174.154.76","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428250857,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282640.png?_r=1433807300","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"andreapurcell1","Id":282640,"Name":"andreapurcell1","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78815,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d21f69ad3b3942f71bdbba7f79d7dd23","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Take a look at Tygrlilly&#039;s thread. She use real touch (Bloom Bridals I think it was) and I don&#039;t believe she had any issue at all. She had all of her flowers in the real touch. I bought her bouts and the feel of them is amazing!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898258,"PostDate":1433864472,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Take a look at Tygrlilly's thread. She use real touch (Bloom Bridals I think it was) and I don't believe she had any issue at all. She had all of her flowers in the real touch. I bought her bouts and the feel of them is amazing!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78815","Title":"Real Touch Flowers","LastPostDate":1433864472},"Pages":{"TotalItems":13,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
