           <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carolyn.webre@selu.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295359193,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235700.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mufin1785","Id":235700,"Name":"Mufin1785","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18b40764d84746be4ff297c6c32b9023","RawContent":"I was wanting to do a picture one like that. I&#039;m worried my pictures won&#039;t be to me in time to get printed I was gonna use engagement a s than have wedding pictures up at the party...or better to just do paper invite with no pictures","Attachments":[],"Id":1739950,"PostDate":1364549653,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was wanting to do a picture one like that. I'm worried my pictures won't be to me in time to get printed I was gonna use engagement a s than have wedding pictures up at the party...or better to just do paper invite with no pictures\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kefritz21@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1364506581,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kefritz","Id":267926,"Name":"kefritz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b65a475a9468d57969064d8504d709eb","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kefritz[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I was wanting to do a picture one like that. I&#039;m worried my pictures won&#039;t be to me in time to get printed I was gonna use engagement a s than have wedding pictures up at the party...or better to just do paper invite with no pictures[\/quote] \n We used HDC photo and had our pictures back before we left the dominican republic.  It depends how much time in between your DW and AHR for what format to use.  We used shutterfly for the cards there turnaround time was pretty quick","Attachments":[],"Id":1739961,"PostDate":1364552595,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kefritz<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I was wanting to do a picture one like that. I'm worried my pictures won't be to me in time to get printed I was gonna use e