, 2012,<br \/> they will slip a ring on each other's <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:perpetua\">finger and make a promise for life. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:perpetua\">On behalf of Mr. & Mrs. H<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> \u00a0and Mr. & Mrs. F<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:perpetua\">you are invited to attend a reception<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:perpetua\">\u00a0to welcome them as husband and wife!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"henrich2@uwm.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1314826036,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244619.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Krs398","Id":244619,"Name":"Krs398","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b3ccde56ffb87a2d75ec6ede69021f1","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Krs398[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n\n[center] [size=4][font=perpetua]On Tuesday, June 26, 2012,\n they will slip a ring on each other&#039;s [\/font][\/size][\/center] \n\n[center] [size=4][font=perpetua]finger and make a promise for life. [\/font][\/size][\/center] \n\n[center] \n [size=4][font=perpetua]On behalf of Mr. &amp;amp; Mrs. H[\/font][\/size][\/center] \n\n[center]  and Mr. &amp;amp; Mrs. F[\/center] \n\n[center] [size=4][font=perpetua]you are invited to attend a reception[\/font][\/size][\/center] \n\n[center] [size=4][font=perpetua] to welcome them as husband and wife![\/font][\/size][\/center][\/quote] \n We are twins! I am getting married on June 26th too!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1597991,"PostDate":1332410131,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Krs398<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:perpetua\">On Tuesday, June 26, 2012,<br \/> they will slip a ring on each other's <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:perpetua\">finger and make a promise for life. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:perpetua\">On behalf of Mr. & Mrs. H<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> \u00a0and Mr. & Mrs. F<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:perpetua\">you are invited to attend a reception<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 7.65pt;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:perpetua\">\u00a0to welcome them as husband and wife!<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> We are twins! I am getting married on June 26th too!!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311615878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"916d0589c43cb8e5d5b9fe8b0bcc8827","RawContent":"It will an amazing day for us!! Yay! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]SunsetLove[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We are twins! I am getting married on June 26th too!!\n   \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1598298,"PostDate":1332454392,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> It will an amazing day for us!! Yay!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>SunsetLove<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We are twins! I am getting married on June 26th too!!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"henrich2@uwm.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1314826036,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244619.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Krs398","Id":244619,"Name":"Krs398","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43e086bf39e85ca799eec23476347b24","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Krs398[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n It will an amazing day for us!! Yay! \n \n \n[\/quote] \n \n \n Yes it will!!! [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1598531,"PostDate":1332517984,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Krs398<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> It will an amazing day for us!! Yay!<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> Yes it will!!! <span alt=\":woot:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1332532342202_163\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311615878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d08d632d130e2250ec4a413e1441d4c6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I loved some of these, but my fiance didn&#039;t seem to like anything too creative and thought we should just go with the formal style. (Oh well, I get my way a lot of times!)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So ours simply say:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Together with their parents, S&amp;amp;S request the pleasure of the company of __________ following their wedding in Florida, at address for Reception with buffet on this date.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We thought we&#039;d put the &#039;together with their parents&#039; as we totally planned and paid for our DW and sent the invitations from our baby son!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I still don&#039;t expect them to pay for anything, but I thought it was a nice gesture as I think my mum was a little hurt that she wasn&#039;t on the other invite as is &#039;traditional&#039;.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1610349,"PostDate":1335119686,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I loved some of these, but my fiance didn't seem to like anything too creative and thought we should just go with the formal style. (Oh well, I get my way a lot of times!)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So ours simply say:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Together with their parents, S&S request the pleasure of the company of __________ following their wedding in Florida, at address for Reception with buffet on this date.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We thought we'd put the 'together with their parents' as we totally planned and paid for our DW and sent the invitations from our baby son!<\/p> <p> I still don't expect them to pay for anything, but I thought it was a nice gesture as I think my mum was a little hurt that she wasn't on the other invite as is 'traditional'.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahgold@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1331983171,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252842.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sbg75","Id":252842,"Name":"sbg75","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43e022cce2c3ab5373ed944512469836","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for all the inspiration everyone! Some really cute ideas&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1622851,"PostDate":1337693558,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for all the inspiration everyone! Some really cute ideas<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kat_lockhart@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.89.250","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1335354776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254510.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katman","Id":254510,"Name":"katman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c68b0fe30d4c2dd6bb520c2282173e2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi all!   We are getting married in Mexico in November and almost 30&amp;nbsp;family and friends will be joining us.&amp;nbsp; After the ceremony we will be having a mini-reception (dinner and dancing) that evening.&amp;nbsp; We are then&amp;nbsp;having an AHR in January and expect about 150 people.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;I was wondering if you have any recommendations\/comments about sending the Mexico invite and the AHR invite together to all 150 people?&amp;nbsp; Do you typically send the Destination invite and AHR invite separately and at separate times?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The invitation would include:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Mexico ceremony&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Mexico &#039;reception&#039; - menu choices and response card&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -AHR Information&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -AHR Response Card&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was thinking about sending them together so those that can&#039;t go to Mexico don&#039;t feel left out and they know that there will be a party to celebrate.&amp;nbsp; The fiance disagrees haha.&amp;nbsp; Any help is appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1650767,"PostDate":1344519906,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi all!\u00a0\u00a0 We are getting married in Mexico in November and almost 30\u00a0family and friends will be joining us.\u00a0 After the ceremony we will be having a mini-reception (dinner and dancing) that evening.\u00a0 We are then\u00a0having an AHR in January and expect about 150 people.\u00a0 \u00a0I was wondering if you have any recommendations\/comments about sending the Mexico invite and the AHR invite together to all 150 people?\u00a0 Do you typically send the Destination invite and AHR invite separately and at separate times?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The invitation would include:<\/p> <p> -Mexico ceremony<\/p> <p> -Mexico 'reception' - menu choices and response card<\/p> <p> -AHR Information<\/p> <p> -AHR Response Card<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was thinking about sending them together so those that can't go to Mexico don't feel left out and they know that there will be a party to celebrate.\u00a0 The fiance disagrees haha.\u00a0 Any help is appreciated!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaruszen@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1332093827,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252879.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jaruszen","Id":252879,"Name":"jaruszen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1e0661525f12a3e2195b6f13fbcc74d","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jaruszen[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi all!   We are getting married in Mexico in November and almost 30 family and friends will be joining us.  After the ceremony we will be having a mini-reception (dinner and dancing) that evening.  We are then having an AHR in January and expect about 150 people.   I was wondering if you have any recommendations\/comments about sending the Mexico invite and the AHR invite together to all 150 people?  Do you typically send the Destination invite and AHR invite separately and at separate times? \n \n The invitation would include: \n -Mexico ceremony \n -Mexico &#039;reception&#039; - menu choices and response card \n -AHR Information \n -AHR Response Card \n \n I was thinking about sending them together so those that can&#039;t go to Mexico don&#039;t feel left out and they know that there will be a party to celebrate.  The fiance disagrees haha.  Any help is appreciated![\/quote] \n \n I have heard a lot of brides on here send them out together, but for me personally I want to send them out separately. We are delivering message-in-a-bottle invites, and want to do that around Christmas. It is a little early, but that way we will be seeing a bunch of the people who are getting them, so we can save on some shipping. I just think ours is too early to send out AHR invites (for August) at that same time. Just my opinion though, and I think it would depend on your family and friends. Plus, I like getting invites in the mail... so I think our guests will be good getting them later in the spring.","Attachments":[],"Id":1651101,"PostDate":1344602162,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jaruszen<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi all!\u00a0\u00a0 We are getting married in Mexico in November and almost 30\u00a0family and friends will be joining us.\u00a0 After the ceremony we will be having a mini-reception (dinner and dancing) that evening.\u00a0 We are then\u00a0having an AHR in January and expect about 150 people.\u00a0 \u00a0I was wondering if you have any recommendations\/comments about sending the Mexico invite and the AHR invite together to all 150 people?\u00a0 Do you typically send the Destination invite and AHR invite separately and at separate times?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The invitation would include:<\/p> <p> -Mexico ceremony<\/p> <p> -Mexico 'reception' - menu choices and response card<\/p> <p> -AHR Information<\/p> <p> -AHR Response Card<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was thinking about sending them together so those that can't go to Mexico don't feel left out and they know that there will be a party to celebrate.\u00a0 The fiance disagrees haha.\u00a0 Any help is appreciated!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have heard a lot of brides on here send them out together, but for me personally I want to send them out separately. We are delivering message-in-a-bottle invites, and want to do that around Christmas. It is a little early, but that way we will be seeing a bunch of the people who are getting them, so we can save on some shipping. I just think ours is too early to send out AHR invites (for August) at that same time. Just my opinion though, and I think it would depend on your family and friends. Plus, I like getting invites in the mail... so I think our guests will be good getting them later in the spring.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krys85418@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.181.124.120","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1301859312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238489.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Peach","Id":238489,"Name":"Peach","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddc2877f27338c6471b3bf14780952b2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px\"&gt;The final wording for the AHR we went with is:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;O&lt;\/em&gt;n&lt;em&gt; the edge of the sand &lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Carolyn and Matthew will slip a Wedding band&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;On one another\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s hand&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Please Join for a Toast &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;To Welcome the Newlyweds Home&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Date time and Location &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1651186,"PostDate":1344612347,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\">The final wording for the AHR we went with is:<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><em>O<\/em>n<em> the edge of the sand <\/em><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><em>Carolyn and Matthew will slip a Wedding band<\/em><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><em><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">On one another\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s hand<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><em><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Please Join for a Toast <\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><em><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">To Welcome the Newlyweds Home<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><em><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Date time and Location <\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carolyn.webre@selu.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295359193,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235700.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mufin1785","Id":235700,"Name":"Mufin1785","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":118,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":100,"PreviousPage":80,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
