, 2009 etc etc\n \n or Mr. &amp;amp; Mrs. Smith have the honour of anouncing the marriage of their daughter Jane Marie to John David on Sat, etc etc, The couple was joined in marriage in a private ceremony in ?. Please join them for a wedding celebration on Staurday etc etc\n \n or a catchy one -- We slipped a ring on each other&#039;s finger and made a promise for life. Join as we celebrate now that we are husband and wife.\n \n You get the idea -- kinda long but maybe you can piece some together\n \n Sue[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1522721,"PostDate":1316615576,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I love the catchy one.. I may just steal that for our ahr<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Sue<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Jane and John Doe are happy to announce their marriage that took place in a private ceremony on June 8, 2009 in Aruba. Please join them for a reception to celebrate their union Saturday August 8, 2009 etc etc<br \/> <br \/> or Mr. & Mrs. Smith have the honour of anouncing the marriage of their daughter Jane Marie to John David on Sat, etc etc, The couple was joined in marriage in a private ceremony in ?. Please join them for a wedding celebration on Staurday etc etc<br \/> <br \/> or a catchy one -- We slipped a ring on each other's finger and made a promise for life. Join as we celebrate now that we are husband and wife.<br \/> <br \/> You get the idea -- kinda long but maybe you can piece some together<br \/> <br \/> Sue<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cuddles_Gently@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1314122440,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244307.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"charitydawn","Id":244307,"Name":"charitydawn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"edd23732f9561a836e9e705631d3b74e","RawContent":"haha yes i read our invitations probably 100 times.. then printed them all out and my friend is like ummm you put bathing suite.. lol luckily a few stratgically placed heart stickers made a little extra omph to our invites and no one was the wiser \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]shan0487[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n welcome! I totally agree- it&#039;s hard when your the one proofreading your own stuff- you need a fresh eye to catch the mistakes! :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1522722,"PostDate":1316615654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> haha yes i read our invitations probably 100 times.. then printed them all out and my friend is like ummm you put bathing suite.. lol luckily a few stratgically placed heart stickers made a little extra omph to our invites and no one was the wiser<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>shan0487<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> welcome! I totally agree- it's hard when your the one proofreading your own stuff- you need a fresh eye to catch the mistakes! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cuddles_Gently@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1314122440,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244307.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"charitydawn","Id":244307,"Name":"charitydawn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a046d4573267a5597cb5ed1b52f7cdc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the fabulous ideas!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1525674,"PostDate":1317086296,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the fabulous ideas!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size:11px;\"><span>Married! May 13 2012!<\/span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"weddingmay@charter.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1312868081,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243536.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":155,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WeddingMay","Id":243536,"Name":"WeddingMay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"def0f00bd0155c4183c4eb581fc4f488","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Clever ideas, thanks for sharing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1565454,"PostDate":1326036597,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Clever ideas, thanks for sharing.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittani.mcfarlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1308829662,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241479.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"brittmcfarlin","Id":241479,"Name":"brittmcfarlin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6883913df09649c5aad7da0f5ce8a96","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;input id=\"gwProxy\" type=\"hidden\" \/&gt;&lt;!--Session data--&gt;&lt;input id=\"jsProxy\" onclick=\"if(typeof(jsCall)==&#039;function&#039;){jsCall();}else{setTimeout(&#039;jsCall()&#039;,500);}\" type=\"hidden\" \/&gt;These are great ideas. Thanks for sharing ladies!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div id=\"refHTML\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1565470,"PostDate":1326037612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <input id=\"gwProxy\" type=\"hidden\" \/><!--Session data--><input id=\"jsProxy\" onclick=\"if(typeof(jsCall)=='function'){jsCall();}else{setTimeout('jsCall()',500);}\" type=\"hidden\" \/>These are great ideas. Thanks for sharing ladies!<\/p> <div id=\"refHTML\"> \u00a0<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"julee.do@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.110.87.22","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1308044958,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241123.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Julietisurs","Id":241123,"Name":"Julietisurs","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":118,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
