> User andreapurcell1 (282640)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea358cf8f7d62a721fbf4d98febe755c","RawContent":"I think its OK to leave out your madien or lasts names since its a little more casual.  Most people will know who you are without your last names included.  Mine was very simple.  The RSVP card had our last name, so in case someone was confused--that should have cleared it up!  Good luck! \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/416917\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mochamakes3[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;m currently trying to get ours done this week. Any comments? \n \n\n[center] [color=rgb(128,86,27)][font=garamond][size=4]Words were spoken, [\/size][\/font][\/color][\/center] \n\n[center] [color=rgb(128,86,27)][font=garamond][size=4]Amidst a soothing tide,[\/size][\/font][\/color][\/center] \n\n[center] [color=rgb(128,86,27)][font=garamond][size=4]As paradise proclaimed,[\/size][\/font][\/color][\/center] \n\n[center] [color=rgb(128,86,27)][font=garamond][size=4]Two souls forever side by side.[\/size][\/font][\/color][\/center] \n \n\n[center] [color=rgb(128,86,27)][font=bickham script pro regular][size=5]Bride &amp;amp; Groom[\/size][\/font][\/color][\/center] \n\n[center] [color=rgb(128,86,27)][font=garamond][size=4]Were Married on Date [\/size][\/font][\/color][\/center] \n \n \n \n\n[center] [color=rgb(128,86,27)][font=garamond][size=4]please join our celebration luncheon.[\/size][\/font][\/color][\/center] \n \n Do you think it&#039;s okay to use my maiden name since I haven&#039;t changed anything yet?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1449387,"PostDate":1305036122,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> I think its OK to leave out your madien or lasts names since its a little more casual.\u00a0 Most people will know who you are without your last names included.\u00a0 Mine was very simple.\u00a0 The RSVP card had our last name, so in case someone was confused--that should have cleared it up!\u00a0 Good luck!<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"MN Invite v4.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/416917\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mochamakes3<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I'm currently trying to get ours done this week. Any comments?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <span  style=\"color: rgb(128,86,27)\"><span  style=\"font-family: garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 14pt\">Words were spoken, <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <span  style=\"color: rgb(128,86,27)\"><span  style=\"font-family: garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 14pt\">Amidst a soothing tide,<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <span  style=\"color: rgb(128,86,27)\"><span  style=\"font-family: garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 14pt\">As paradise proclaimed,<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <span  style=\"color: rgb(128,86,27)\"><span  style=\"font-family: garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 14pt\">Two souls forever side by side.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <span  style=\"color: rgb(128,86,27)\"><span  style=\"font-family: bickham script pro regular\"><span  style=\"font-size: 20pt\">Bride & Groom<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <span  style=\"color: rgb(128,86,27)\"><span  style=\"font-family: garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 14pt\">Were Married on Date <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <span  style=\"color: rgb(128,86,27)\"><span  style=\"font-family: garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 14pt\">please join our celebration luncheon.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do you think it's okay to use my maiden name since I haven't changed anything yet?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephanielcantu@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1270220258,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226993.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeeLee","Id":226993,"Name":"LeeLee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d956749cbba79ff32a791f9dca13b03","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Fantastic ideas! Thanks for the suggestions!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1449685,"PostDate":1305062518,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Fantastic ideas! Thanks for the suggestions!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abrin21@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304544428,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239653.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"abrin21","Id":239653,"Name":"abrin21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4030272927e9b64a0373d04c7db193e","RawContent":"Perhaps there is different etiquette in the UK where this bride is from?? Who&#039;s to say what etiquette is anymore???????!!!!!!  There aren&#039;t any hard rules anymore. You also don&#039;t know who her guests are. Maybe it&#039;s totally fine to them. Maybe you should find out more info before making a judgement call like this. Just sayin \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LeeLee[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n OMG...I read this and almost choked!  Not trying to be rude, but it is against all proper etiquiette to even state where you are registered on an invite--let alone tell people that you want cash!  I just want to pass along proper etiquiette for other brides...just because you are planning a relaxed and fun destination wedding doesn&#039;t mean you should throw all rules to the wind.  Just my two cents!  Thanks!  \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1449699,"PostDate":1305063803,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Perhaps there is different etiquette in the UK where this bride is from?? Who's to say what etiquette is anymore???????!!!!!!\u00a0 There aren't any hard rules anymore. You also don't know who her guests are. Maybe it's totally fine to them. Maybe you should find out more info before making a judgement call like this. Just sayin<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LeeLee<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> OMG...I read this and almost choked!\u00a0 Not trying to be rude, but it is against all proper etiquiette to even state where you are registered on an invite--let alone tell people that you want cash!\u00a0 I just want to pass along proper etiquiette for other brides...just because you are planning a relaxed and fun destination wedding doesn't mean you should throw all rules to the wind.\u00a0 Just my two cents!\u00a0 Thanks!\u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elese.t.m.l@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1297811904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236844.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lesee","Id":236844,"Name":"lesee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ba892bb6e134a3a2295771304a7f784","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I think they are all great. I laughed out loud on the money one and if it works for them how great. I would love people to give money only! lol... we are doing a post Cabo reception and i was wondering if and how people would know where we were registered if we didnt say it..ya know? We dont have a wedding website so im kind of lost. I like all the catchy rythems\/poems...i would think most of these are for fun laid back POST reception. There should be no stress... We are calling it a Post Cabo Picture Showing, or something like that... we will have all our wedding pics playing on a slide show from the projector... i think everyone will feel involved and included that way ;)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We will see...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1462236,"PostDate":1307033445,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I think they are all great. I laughed out loud on the money one and if it works for them how great. I would love people to give money only! lol... we are doing a post Cabo reception and i was wondering if and how people would know where we were registered if we didnt say it..ya know? We dont have a wedding website so im kind of lost. I like all the catchy rythems\/poems...i would think most of these are for fun laid back POST reception. There should be no stress... We are calling it a Post Cabo Picture Showing, or something like that... we will have all our wedding pics playing on a slide show from the projector... i think everyone will feel involved and included that way <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We will see...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sara.strawick@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1295030099,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235543.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IdOinCABO","Id":235543,"Name":"IdOinCABO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d19bec46f1adca099e2043d13f88f46","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; All the ideas and suggestions have been so helpful!&amp;nbsp; I just need to figure out how soon in advance to send them.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1462321,"PostDate":1307040985,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> All the ideas and suggestions have been so helpful!\u00a0 I just need to figure out how soon in advance to send them.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mellojess83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305807112,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240183.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MelloJess83","Id":240183,"Name":"MelloJess83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"613146f864b5bb6660d9dfb65eb54349","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great ideas&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1463156,"PostDate":1307147944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great ideas<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msdiknowlton@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1305632231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240111.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ms Di","Id":240111,"Name":"Ms Di","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4c2859baa43586061b9058e5993a3d8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; this is great! thanks&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1480647,"PostDate":1309735635,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> this is great! thanks<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dstylist0624@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1304376480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239576.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cGd41812","Id":239576,"Name":"cGd41812","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0906b0341a15234ac06fab8efe84da30","RawContent":"Would you mind sharing where you got your AHR invitations? I love them!! Thank you! \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]proti007[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Here&#039;s ours! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/413691\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n Thanks to everyone who helped with wording from this thread! \n \n Natalie[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1513254,"PostDate":1314738982,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Would you mind sharing where you got your AHR invitations? I love them!! Thank you!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>proti007<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Here's ours!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_1170.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/413691\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks to everyone who helped with wording from this thread!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Natalie<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Dreams Palm Beach Punta Cana, Dominican Republic - December 2, 2011<\/span><br><span>32 friends and family + bride and groom + Dreams Palm Beach = one amazing week and spectacular wedding!!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jnleah@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280771782,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230954.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenleah","Id":230954,"Name":"jenleah","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4460ce699bb22ff84cf3a65e9eb4ac84","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Natalie - I loved your wording so much that I stole it!!&amp;nbsp; Thanks for sharing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here are the ones we are thinking of.&amp;nbsp; Anyone have some good ideas on how to word it that its a black and white affair and all guests must wear black or white?&amp;nbsp; Do I need to be so blunt?&amp;nbsp; I think many will not know what it means or may not pay attention unless we spell it out for them.&amp;nbsp; We plan on inserting a small card with that info along with what time the ship boards, departs, map etc.&amp;nbsp; Also, can you guys chime in on the \"Hosted by\" line ?&amp;nbsp; His parents are paying for the reception but they would like my parents names on there.&amp;nbsp; Does it look weird with so many names...so many different names?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thoughts??&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"invite-example1.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/531004\/width\/350\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 454px; height: 555px;\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1513485,"PostDate":1314793477,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Natalie - I loved your wording so much that I stole it!!\u00a0 Thanks for sharing.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here are the ones we are thinking of.\u00a0 Anyone have some good ideas on how to word it that its a black and white affair and all guests must wear black or white?\u00a0 Do I need to be so blunt?\u00a0 I think many will not know what it means or may not pay attention unless we spell it out for them.\u00a0 We plan on inserting a small card with that info along with what time the ship boards, departs, map etc.\u00a0 Also, can you guys chime in on the \"Hosted by\" line ?\u00a0 His parents are paying for the reception but they would like my parents names on there.\u00a0 Does it look weird with so many names...so many different names?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thoughts??<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"invite-example1.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/531004\/width\/350\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 454px; height: 555px;\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sxctaz18@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1279739050,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230504.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":123,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sxcT","Id":230504,"Name":"sxcT","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a2b5ff2e487172f4254383e1a6e54bd","RawContent":"I think the invite looks great! Minus one minor error- the reception has a date of 2011- don&#039;t you mean 2012? :)\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]sxcT[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Natalie - I loved your wording so much that I stole it!!  Thanks for sharing.  \n \n Here are the ones we are thinking of.  Anyone have some good ideas on how to word it that its a black and white affair and all guests must wear black or white?  Do I need to be so blunt?  I think many will not know what it means or may not pay attention unless we spell it out for them.  We plan on inserting a small card with that info along with what time the ship boards, departs, map etc.  Also, can you guys chime in on the \"Hosted by\" line ?  His parents are paying for the reception but they would like my parents names on there.  Does it look weird with so many names...so many different names? \n \n Thoughts?? \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/531004\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]\n   \n \n   \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1513502,"PostDate":1314795741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I think the invite looks great! Minus one minor error- the reception has a date of 2011- don't you mean 2012? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>sxcT<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Natalie - I loved your wording so much that I stole it!!\u00a0 Thanks for sharing.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here are the ones we are thinking of.\u00a0 Anyone have some good ideas on how to word it that its a black and white affair and all guests must wear black or white?\u00a0 Do I need to be so blunt?\u00a0 I think many will not know what it means or may not pay attention unless we spell it out for them.\u00a0 We plan on inserting a small card with that info along with what time the ship boards, departs, map etc.\u00a0 Also, can you guys chime in on the \"Hosted by\" line ?\u00a0 His parents are paying for the reception but they would like my parents names on there.\u00a0 Does it look weird with so many names...so many different names?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thoughts??<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"invite-example1.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/531004\/width\/350\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 454px; height: 555px\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294245874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":118,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
