{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d189b7f9315412986becf815323173f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; love the invite hazel!! what does the back of invite look like? do you mind sharing it with us. I really want to&amp;nbsp;see it! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1410992,"PostDate":1299282935,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> love the invite hazel!! what does the back of invite look like? do you mind sharing it with us. I really want to\u00a0see it! \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Negril, Jamaica<\/span><br><span>6\/29\/11<\/span><br><span>24 booked =)<\/span><br><span>Can't wait til the big day!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sharliehusted@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1280882955,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230999.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sharlie","Id":230999,"Name":"sharlie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9cf557b58f2bd929093072b7faa0a2e1","RawContent":"Perfect!!!  \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]greysgirl[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Our AHR invite reads: \n \n ------- and -------- are pleased to announce they will be married on Monday, April 11th during a private ceremony in Maui.  Please join us for a celebration when we return as husband and wife on Saturday, April 30th at Seven O&#039;Clock in the evening (with our venue listed).[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1411035,"PostDate":1299299479,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> Perfect!!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>greysgirl<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Our AHR invite reads:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> ------- and -------- are pleased to announce they will be married on Monday, April 11th during a private ceremony in Maui.\u00a0 Please join us for a celebration when we return as husband and wife on Saturday, April 30th at Seven O'Clock in the evening (with our venue listed).<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ntiernan615@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284851870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232454.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NikkiT1021","Id":232454,"Name":"NikkiT1021","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"971c0388b36613a23d38a17233d3ac6c","RawContent":"this is awesome!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]HazelsMelody[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n This thread totally helped me in doing my invitations. I did them as postcards on Vistaprint, they&#039;ll be mailed out as soon as we&#039;re back from Cuba. Here&#039;s how the front turned out: \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/312345\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1411042,"PostDate":1299303355,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> this is awesome!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>HazelsMelody<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> This thread totally helped me in doing my invitations. I did them as postcards on Vistaprint, they'll be mailed out as soon as we're back from Cuba. Here's how the front turned out:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"AHR Invite06.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/312345\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandraroy3@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"69.42.184.99","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295765247,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"PurpleUnicorn","Id":235879,"Name":"PurpleUnicorn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"783fb3023446c3bbe0d1a4a0b9c9ccfe","RawContent":"Sure! Here&#039;s the back.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]sharlie[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n love the invite hazel!! what does the back of invite look like? do you mind sharing it with us. I really want to see it![\/quote] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/313036\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1411151,"PostDate":1299330173,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sure! Here's the back.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>sharlie<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> love the invite hazel!! what does the back of invite look like? do you mind sharing it with us. I really want to\u00a0see it! \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"AHR Invite07.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/313036\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Iberostar Varadero<\/span><br><span>25 March 2011<\/span><br><i>Bride & Groom and kids + 20 booked.<\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hazels_melody@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1265660536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225438.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HazelsMelody","Id":225438,"Name":"HazelsMelody","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"944106a0eda6735cae854b8a2bf90890","RawContent":"OMG...I read this and almost choked!  Not trying to be rude, but it is against all proper etiquiette to even state where you are registered on an invite--let alone tell people that you want cash!  I just want to pass along proper etiquiette for other brides...just because you are planning a relaxed and fun destination wedding doesn&#039;t mean you should throw all rules to the wind.  Just my two cents!  Thanks!  [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Susan&#039;n&#039;Dean[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Groom &amp;amp; Bride are set to marry in COUNTRY on DATE \n \n An evening reception will take place in the uk in order to celebrate with friends and family \n \n You are invited to come along! \n DATE \n TIME \n PLACE \n \n So what do you get for the bride and groom \n Whose house needs work done in every room \n Whose hopes are to be in the family way \n Soon after they return from their special day! \n When shopping for a present please dont be rash \n As there is always the option to just give cash! \n We hope you dont find out request to be funny \n But we really would appreciate a gift of money :-) \n \n RSVP by - -\/- -\/- - to ADDRESS or EMAIL[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1431093,"PostDate":1302189491,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> OMG...I read this and almost choked!\u00a0 Not trying to be rude, but it is against all proper etiquiette to even state where you are registered on an invite--let alone tell people that you want cash!\u00a0 I just want to pass along proper etiquiette for other brides...just because you are planning a relaxed and fun destination wedding doesn't mean you should throw all rules to the wind.\u00a0 Just my two cents!\u00a0 Thanks!\u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Susan'n'Dean<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Groom & Bride are set to marry in COUNTRY on DATE<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> An evening reception will take place in the uk in order to celebrate with friends and family<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You are invited to come along!<\/p> <p> DATE<\/p> <p> TIME<\/p> <p> PLACE<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So what do you get for the bride and groom<\/p> <p> Whose house needs work done in every room<\/p> <p> Whose hopes are to be in the family way<\/p> <p> Soon after they return from their special day!<\/p> <p> When shopping for a present please dont be rash<\/p> <p> As there is always the option to just give cash!<\/p> <p> We hope you dont find out request to be funny<\/p> <p> But we really would appreciate a gift of money :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> RSVP by - -\/- -\/- - to ADDRESS or EMAIL<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephanielcantu@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1270220258,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226993.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeeLee","Id":226993,"Name":"LeeLee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"485539f00c163cf62cf782d0180e129b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; WOW! OMG! I hope that bride never sent out invitations like that...terrible! I would be offended if I ever got an invite like this!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1431699,"PostDate":1302278633,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> WOW! OMG! I hope that bride never sent out invitations like that...terrible! I would be offended if I ever got an invite like this!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/MiSam7.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/MiSam7.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"deannamarie85@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274910904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228595.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deannamarie85","Id":228595,"Name":"deannamarie85","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2570314849ba68297599a1f12d876128","RawContent":"I agree with you LeeLee [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LeeLee[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n OMG...I read this and almost choked!  Not trying to be rude, but it is against all proper etiquiette to even state where you are registered on an invite--let alone tell people that you want cash!  I just want to pass along proper etiquiette for other brides...just because you are planning a relaxed and fun destination wedding doesn&#039;t mean you should throw all rules to the wind.  Just my two cents!  Thanks!  \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1432195,"PostDate":1302385569,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> I agree with you LeeLee<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LeeLee<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> OMG...I read this and almost choked!\u00a0 Not trying to be rude, but it is against all proper etiquiette to even state where you are registered on an invite--let alone tell people that you want cash!\u00a0 I just want to pass along proper etiquiette for other brides...just because you are planning a relaxed and fun destination wedding doesn't mean you should throw all rules to the wind.\u00a0 Just my two cents!\u00a0 Thanks!\u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Negril, Jamaica<\/span><br><span>6\/29\/11<\/span><br><span>24 booked =)<\/span><br><span>Can't wait til the big day!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sharliehusted@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1280882955,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230999.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sharlie","Id":230999,"Name":"sharlie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da38b8676b61c052cd3322dda7041015","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Here are our Vista Invites for the AHR... We included the word \"intimate\" as a way to say \"you weren&#039;t invited to the DW cause we kept it small\"&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"AHR.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/398160\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1443396,"PostDate":1304088276,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Here are our Vista Invites for the AHR... We included the word \"intimate\" as a way to say \"you weren't invited to the DW cause we kept it small\"<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"AHR.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/398160\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megan_dumas@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1279398625,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230363.bmp?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meggers7484","Id":230363,"Name":"Meggers7484","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fabbde833580d0f73cc27e8a34da302f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Here&#039;s ours!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_1170.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/413691\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks to everyone who helped with wording from this thread!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Natalie&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1448483,"PostDate":1304897853,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Here's ours!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_1170.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/413691\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks to everyone who helped with wording from this thread!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Natalie<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"proti007@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1279074019,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230212.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"proti007","Id":230212,"Name":"proti007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"280460f156566ed860e0caa379b17557","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m currently trying to get ours done this week. Any comments?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(128, 86, 27);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: garamond,serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"&gt;Words were spoken, &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(128, 86, 27);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: garamond,serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"&gt;Amidst a soothing tide,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(128, 86, 27);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: garamond,serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"&gt;As paradise proclaimed,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(128, 86, 27);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: garamond,serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"&gt;Two souls forever side by side.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(128, 86, 27);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: bickham script pro regular;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 20pt;\"&gt;Bride &amp;am