HR invite reads:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> ------- and -------- are pleased to announce they will be married on Monday, April 11th during a private ceremony in Maui.\u00a0 Please join us for a celebration when we return as husband and wife on Saturday, April 30th at Seven O'Clock in the evening (with our venue listed).<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunandstefanie@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295537051,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235778.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":215,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Starfish0512","Id":235778,"Name":"Starfish0512","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d159385de4a1ef2814a9173e99e7308","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Susan&#039;n&#039;Dean[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n So what do you get for the bride and groom \n Whose house needs work done in every room \n Whose hopes are to be in the family way \n Soon after they return from their special day! \n When shopping for a present please dont be rash \n As there is always the option to just give cash! \n We hope you dont find out request to be funny \n But we really would appreciate a gift of money :-) \n \n RSVP by - -\/- -\/- - to ADDRESS or EMAIL[\/quote] \n \n I LOVE THIS!!!! LOL we&#039;re totally using it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1407585,"PostDate":1298895176,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n       