 when we were designing our invites. I&#039;m not the rhyming type and we were sending out our AHR invites before we were officially married. This is what we came up with:\n \n We are happy to announce that we will be married on *date* in a private ceremony in the Riviera Maya surrounded by the sun, the sand and the sea\n \n We invite you to join us for a celebration when we return as husband and wife\n \n (followed by date, location, time, RSVP, etc)\n \n Hope this helps!","Attachments":[],"Id":1079959,"PostDate":1268862355,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I struggled with this when we were designing our invites. I'm not the rhyming type and we were sending out our AHR invites before we were officially married. This is what we came up with:<br \/> <br \/> We are happy to announce that we will be married on *date* in a private ceremony in the Riviera Maya surrounded by the sun, the sand and the sea<br \/> <br \/> We invite you to join us for a celebration when we return as husband and wife<br \/> <br \/> (followed by date, location, time, RSVP, etc)<br \/> <br \/> Hope this helps!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married May 12, 2010<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/kayleys-krama-planning-thread-58704\/\">My Planning Thread<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/kayleys-gran-bahia-principe-coba-review-may