p;amp; Hor dourves begin at 7&#039;\n but I want ppl to know that that at 8pm we are beginning speeches, wedding video, and 1st dance. I just dont know what to call it. I don&#039;t just want to say &#039;reception begins at 8&#039; since some people may take that to mean they can show up at any time after 8- I dont want ppl arriving in the middle of speeches. Any advice? Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":916151,"PostDate":1257640568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have a question on how to do the working for times. I am going to indicate <br \/> 'cocktails & Hor dourves begin at 7'<br \/> but I want ppl to know that that at 8pm we are beginning speeches, wedding video, and 1st dance. I just dont know what to call it. I don't just want to say 'reception begins at 8' since some people may take that to mean they can show up at any time after 8- I dont want ppl arriving in the middle of speeches. Any advice? Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a_dawn_w@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232598802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"a_dawn_w","Id":214192,"Name":"a_dawn_w","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","Ed