                  font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great website. Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"KGraham27@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1266002641,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225552.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KGraham27","Id":225552,"Name":"KGraham27","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"983b3dd39058f28516c7a6d718f27691","RawContent":"Here is my AHR wording...\n \n &amp;quot;Parents&amp;quot;\n and &amp;quot;Parents&amp;quot;\n are pleased to announce \n the marriage of their children\n Ashley Michelle and Justin David\n on Sunday, the sixteenth of May\n two thousand ten\n in a private ceremony\n on the beach in\n Playa del Carmen, Mexico.\n \n Please join us for a\n celebration of their marriage\n when they return\n as husband and wife\n Saturday, the twenty-second of May\n two thousand ten\n at six o&#039;clock\n \n &amp;quot;Address of reception&amp;quot;","Attachments":[],"Id":1044590,"PostDate":1266776184,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is my AHR wording...<br \/> <br \/> \"Parents\"<br \/> and \"Parents\"<br \/> are pleased to announce <br \/> the marriage of their children<br \/> Ashley Michelle and Justin David<br \/> on Sunday, the sixteenth of May<br \/> two thousand ten<br \/> in a private ceremony<br \/> on the beach in<br \/> Playa del Carmen, Mexico.<br \/> <br \/> Please join us for a<br \/> celebration of their marriage<br \/> when they return<br \/> as husband and wife<br \/> Saturday, the twenty-second of May<br \/> two thousand ten<br \/> at six o'clock<br \/> <br \/> \"Address of reception\"\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleystreit@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1260475747,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223849.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"astreit","Id":223849,"Name":"astreit","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd8aa49b6bd72be9c92399d4ab46dc39","RawContent":"I love all the ideas! This is what I was thinking about doing...let me know what y&#039;all think. \n \n Option 1:\n As the sun sets low in the Key West sky\n Derek &amp;amp; Kendra will become man and wife!\n \n Join us as we celebrate their marriage with a reception at...\n \n *Reception info to follow*\n \n I don&#039;t know if I should say &amp;quot;will become&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;became&amp;quot; man and wife since the inviations will go out right around the time of our wedding.\n \n Option 2:\n With their toes in the sand\n and a sunset sky\n Derek &amp;amp; Kendra will become man &amp;amp; wife!\n \n The couple will be married in a small beach ceremony\n on August 9th among family and friends\n \n PLease join us as we celebrate their marriage with a reception...","Attachments":[],"Id":1049558,"PostDate":1267045136,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love all the ideas! This is what I was thinking about doing...let me know what y'all think. <br \/> <br \/> Option 1:<br \/> As the sun sets low in the Key West sky<br \/> Derek & Kendra will become man and wife!<br \/> <br \/> Join us as we celebrate their marriage with a reception at...<br \/> <br \/> *Reception info to follow*<br \/> <br \/> I don't know if I should say \"will become\" or \"became\" man and wife since the inviations will go out right around the time of our wedding.<br \/> <br \/> Option 2:<br \/> With their toes in the sand<br \/> and a sunset sky<br \/> Derek & Kendra will become man & wife!<br \/> <br \/> The couple will be married in a small beach ceremony<br \/> on August 9th among family and friends<br \/> <br \/> PLease join us as we celebrate their marriage with a reception...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;105\/st\/20100809\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/715b\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...715b\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kwaits@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1259109364,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223518.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kwaits","Id":223518,"Name":"kwaits","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7548c98905b3a670bcd0e5cbb56118bf","RawContent":"We are getting married in January, but won&#039;t have our AHR until late spring or early summer ....weather is too unpredictable in Minnesota in Jan! Any tips on how\/when to send out the AHR invites?","Attachments":[],"Id":1050008,"PostDate":1267055808,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are getting married in January, but won't have our AHR until late spring or early summer ....weather is too unpredictable in Minnesota in Jan! Any tips on how\/when to send out the AHR invites?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michelle_mckinney1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1261972100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224117.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"michelle10","Id":224117,"Name":"michelle10","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":118,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
