Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b8d8001708aa24ab24730cd6db1abd4","RawContent":"Okay I read every post in this thread and I have only found a few invitation wording samples. So I thought it might be helpful for me and others if everyone could post how they worded their invites or how they plan to do so.\n \n Right now my plans is to have these mailed (from someone in the states) the day after we are married in Mexico. Guests should receive them about 1 month before the AHR. Our save the dates also had the AHR on it, so most people already have the date set aside. \n \n I bought invitations at Michaels and plan to print them this weekend so I can mark that off my to-do list! But I need to figure out the wording! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":734415,"PostDate":1245781207,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Okay I read every post in this thread and I have only found a few invitation wording samples. So I thought it might be helpful for me and others if everyone could post how they worded their invites or how they plan to do so.<br \/> <br \/> Right now my plans is to have these mailed (from someone in the states) the day after we are married in Mexico. Guests should receive them about 1 month before the AHR. Our save the dates also had the AHR on it, so most people already have the date set aside. <br \/> <br \/> I bought invitations at Michaels and plan to print them this weekend so I can mark that off my to-do list! But I need to figure out the wording! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pennycarter@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1243782482,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217967.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VioletVol","Id":217967,"Name":"VioletVol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eca13559d1dc00a12e49780be4899709","RawContent":"I was curious what other used for wording as well.\n My invitations are going to look a little formal but I didn&#039;t want a formal reception so I am going to find some fun wording for it.\n I found these two that I am considering:\n \n They got their feet wet and played in the sand\n And oh yes, they joined their hands! \n Jason and Patty were wed October 1 on St. Vincent Island. \n \n In celebration of their marriage\n On November 22 at noon\n Please attend a backyard barbeque at\n Host\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Home, Hostess Way, Indiana \n \n or\n \n You don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t need a ticket\n or an advance reservation,\n just make waves\n to our wedding celebration. \n \n BRIDE\n and\n GROOM\n will be married on\n DATE\n LOCATION\n Please join them for a reception\n when they return\n DATE at TIME\n LOCATION\n ADDRESS\n CITY, STATE","Attachments":[],"Id":763597,"PostDate":1247802665,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was curious what other used for wording as well.<br \/> My invitations are going to look a little formal but I didn't want a formal reception so I am going to find some fun wording for it.<br \/> I found these two that I am considering:<br \/> <br \/> They got their feet wet and played in the sand<br \/> And oh yes, they joined their hands! <br \/> Jason and Patty were wed October 1 on St. Vincent Island. <br \/> <br \/> In celebration of their marriage<br \/> On November 22 at noon<br \/> Please attend a backyard barbeque at<br \/> Host\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Home, Hostess Way, Indiana <br \/> <br \/> or<br \/> <br \/> You don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t need a ticket<br \/> or an advance reservation,<br \/> just make waves<br \/> to our wedding celebration. <br \/> <br \/> BRIDE<br \/> and<br \/> GROOM<br \/> will be married on<br \/> DATE<br \/> LOCATION<br \/> Please join them for a reception<br \/> when they return<br \/> DATE at TIME<br \/> LOCATION<br \/> ADDRESS<br \/> CITY, STATE\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;131\/st\/20091018\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/b25c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...b25c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"patriciaspiegel@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1225336320,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212466.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mspattemac","Id":212466,"Name":"mspattemac","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"730b183b8ea0ba2e3c2949d917d1175b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;mspattemac&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I was curious what other used for wording as well.\n My invitations are going to look a little formal but I didn&#039;t want a formal reception so I am going to find some fun wording for it.\n I found these two that I am considering:\n \n They got their feet wet and played in the sand\n And oh yes, they joined their hands! \n Jason and Patty were wed October 1 on St. Vincent Island. \n \n In celebration of their marriage\n On November 22 at noon\n Please attend a backyard barbeque at\n Host\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Home, Hostess Way, Indiana \n \n or\n \n You don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t need a ticket\n or an advance reservation,\n just make waves\n to our wedding celebration. \n \n BRIDE\n and\n GROOM\n will be married on\n DATE\n LOCATION\n Please join them for a reception\n when they return\n DATE at TIME\n LOCATION\n ADDRESS\n CITY, STATE&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;so cute gonna steal that!!!!!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":763604,"PostDate":1247802905,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>mspattemac<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I was curious what other used for wording as well.<br \/> My invitations are going to look a little formal but I didn't want a formal reception so I am going to find some fun wording for it.<br \/> I found these two that I am considering:<br \/> <br \/> They got their feet wet and played in the sand<br \/> And oh yes, they joined their hands! <br \/> Jason and Patty were wed October 1 on St. Vincent Island. <br \/> <br \/> In celebration of their marriage<br \/> On November 22 at noon<br \/> Please attend a backyard barbeque at<br \/> Host\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Home, Hostess Way, Indiana <br \/> <br \/> or<br \/> <br \/> You don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t need a ticket<br \/> or an advance reservation,<br \/> just make waves<br \/> to our wedding celebration. <br \/> <br \/> BRIDE<br \/> and<br \/> GROOM<br \/> will be married on<br \/> DATE<br \/> LOCATION<br \/> Please join them for a reception<br \/> when they return<br \/> DATE at TIME<br \/> LOCATION<br \/> ADDRESS<br \/> CITY, STATE<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>so cute gonna steal that!!!!!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"march132010@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1238008800,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216144.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"march132010","Id":216144,"Name":"march132010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f068da74a8b34ec5b302fae3309abb5c","RawContent":"You don&#8217;t need a ticket\n or an advance reservation,\n just make waves\n to our wedding celebration. \n \n \n that is so cute i love it!","Attachments":[],"Id":763651,"PostDate":1247804732,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You don&#8217;t need a ticket<br \/> or an advance reservation,<br \/> just make waves<br \/> to our wedding celebration. <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> that is so cute i love it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i620.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt288\/wendals\/wedding\/IMG_6421PoolParty1-resized.jpg\">http:\/\/i620.photobucket.com\/albums\/t...y1-resized.jpg<\/a><br><i>photo by nora bohanon<\/i><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.norasweddingblog.com\/?p=1607\">http:\/\/www.norasweddingblog.com\/?p=1607<\/a><br><br><span>my GBP wedding review!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/midnight24-gran-bahia-principe-coba-tulum-wedding-fri-april-23-2010-pics-links-59687\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...s-links-59687\/<\/a><span>we've been blogged!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/destinationinspirations.com\/?p=1507\">http:\/\/destinationinspirations.com\/?p=1507<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"wendals24@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1236061177,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215437.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"midnight24","Id":215437,"Name":"midnight24","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51301cd820dfd53bf6b1db726834e1ea","RawContent":"the wording is so cute","Attachments":[],"Id":765930,"PostDate":1248023238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                the wording is so cute\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deirdraw2003@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1225218222,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212441.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mimosa123","Id":212441,"Name":"mimosa123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2d2f71e1a88c946d22c0fcb943c9c0a","RawContent":"I lovee the first one. I am going to steal that. Thanks :)","Attachments":[],"Id":766002,"PostDate":1248028998,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I lovee the first one. I am going to steal that. Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mrs. Young<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lvanrood@uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245276500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218553.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":66,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ML YoungLove","Id":218553,"Name":"ML YoungLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c27fe8e7348477f72add944b809d55c","RawContent":"Thanks for these!! Does anyone have any more examples?","Attachments":[],"Id":770671,"PostDate":1248275704,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for these!! Does anyone have any more examples?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Maggie<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i37.photobucket.com\/albums\/e57\/marg2265\/IMG_3306-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i37.photobucket.com\/albums\/e5...IMG_3306-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"maggiecblackman@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1235420631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215188.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lolosmama","Id":215188,"Name":"lolosmama","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ceffc9855876e7256f9ac6154b671118","RawContent":"Well my fianc\u00a9 actually surprised the heck out of me and came up with one on his own. \n This is from memory so it might be off a little.\n \n Now they are back from their fun in the sun\n and promised forever their lives as one \n John and Jane Doe would like to invite you \u00e2\u20ac\u00a6..\n \n or \n \n Now they are back from their fun in the sun\n and promised forever united as one","Attachments":[],"Id":779126,"PostDate":1248813285,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Well my fianc\u00a9 actually surprised the heck out of me and came up with one on his own. <br \/> This is from memory so it might be off a little.<br \/> <br \/> Now they are back from their fun in the sun<br \/> and promised forever their lives as one <br \/> John and Jane Doe would like to invite you \u00e2\u20ac\u00a6..<br \/> <br \/> or <br \/> <br \/> Now they are back from their fun in the sun<br \/> and promised forever united as one\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;131\/st\/20091018\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/b25c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...b25c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"patriciaspiegel@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1225336320,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212466.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mspattemac","Id":212466,"Name":"mspattemac","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47a69552b9fd85b81c7f0494434d1024","RawContent":"Jane and John Doe are happy to announce their marriage that took place in a private ceremony on June 8, 2009 in Aruba. Please join them for a reception to celebrate their union Saturday August 8, 2009 etc etc\n \n or Mr. &amp;amp; Mrs. Smith have the honour of anouncing the marriage of their daughter Jane Marie to John David on Sat, etc etc, The couple was joined in marriage in a private ceremony in ?. Please join them for a wedding celebration on Staurday etc etc \n \n or a catchy one -- We slipped a ring on each other&#039;s finger and made a promise for life. Join as we celebrate now that we are husband and wife.\n \n You get the idea -- kinda long but maybe you can piece some together\n \n Sue","Attachments":[],"Id":785304,"PostDate":1249239010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jane and John Doe are happy to announce their marriage that took place in a private ceremony on June 8, 2009 in Aruba. Please join them for a reception to celebrate their union Saturday August 8, 2009 etc etc<br \/> <br \/> or Mr. & Mrs. Smith have the honour of anouncing the marriage of their daughter Jane Marie to John David on Sat, etc etc, The couple was joined in marriage in a private ceremony in ?. Please join them for a wedding celebration on Staurday etc etc <br \/> <br \/> or a catchy one -- We slipped a ring on each other's finger and made a promise for life. Join as we celebrate now that we are husband and wife.<br \/> <br \/> You get the idea -- kinda long but maybe you can piece some together<br \/> <br \/> Sue\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sue@holmesautomotiverecycling.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1249006789,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220019.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sue","Id":220019,"Name":"Sue","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b215f59f0043dad969c7996a9bbec09","RawContent":"These are all very cute ideas! Might have to steal one of them :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":785316,"PostDate":1249240321,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                These are all very cute ideas! Might have to steal one of them :-)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"julieirabon@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1240434816,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216950.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"julzcabo","Id":216950,"Name":"julzcabo","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":118,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
