le":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa1d29cf7cd0ecc078879a91e576b908","RawContent":"Oh yeah I refuse to rhyme too :) \n \n I sent Save the Dates out b\/c I was afraid ppl would think they were not invited to anything if they did not get the Mexico invite. So we said:\n \n Save the Date\n \n for the Stateside Reception for\n Mark\n and\n Amy\n \n The couple is having a small wedding in mexico and hopes that you can join them upon their return to celebrate their marriage\n \n invitation to follow closer to date.","Attachments":[],"Id":807455,"PostDate":1250710105,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh yeah I refuse to rhyme too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> I sent Save the Dates out b\/c I was afraid ppl would think they were not invited to anything if they did not get the Mexico invite. So we said:<br \/> <br \/> Save the Date<br \/> <br \/> for the Stateside Reception for<br \/> Mark<br \/> and<br \/> Amy<br \/> <br \/> The couple is having a small wedding in mexico and hopes that you can join them upon their return to celebrate their marriage<br \/> <br \/> invitation to follow closer to date.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amywolfy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1239413159,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216642.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amybermuda","Id":216642,"Name":"amybermuda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5731d0856bad549183043040f7f03ae2","RawContent":"whoops - really said \n \n for the Stateside Reception of\n Mark\n and\n Amy","Attachments":[],"Id":807458,"PostDate":1250710172,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                whoops - really said <br \/> <br \/> for the Stateside Reception of<br \/> Mark<br \/> and<br \/> Amy\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amywolfy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1239413159,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216642.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amybermuda","Id":216642,"Name":"amybermuda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa20eef5c11d28597a306aee77850f19","RawContent":"You should try &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.verseit.com\"&gt;VerseIt.com&lt;\/a&gt;. It has a bunch of great wording for all types of invitations. We got our AHR wording from there.","Attachments":[],"Id":807465,"PostDate":1250710447,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You should try <a href='http:\/\/www.verseit.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>VerseIt.com<\/a>. It has a bunch of great wording for all types of invitations. We got our AHR wording from there.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>- Grace<\/span><br><span>Location - Chateau de Challain, Challain la Potherie, France<\/span><br><span>Engagement Date - Sept. 6, 2008<\/span><br><span>Wedding Date - Sept. 9, 2009<\/span><br><span>Our Pro wedding photo website:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/fanelliwedding.shutterfly.com\/propictures\/5?size=All&startIndex=0\">http:\/\/fanelliwedding.shutterfly.com...l&startIndex=0<\/a><span>Our wedding planning website:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/graceandmichael\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/graceandmichael<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"grace_oh@uhc.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221624926,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211785.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GracieBebe","Id":211785,"Name":"GracieBebe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"196c7961ed8c1b5bab659b1172aa1317","RawContent":"Thanks for the website! Excellent reference!","Attachments":[],"Id":809419,"PostDate":1250820482,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the website! Excellent reference!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela_105@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1245886690,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218775.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Angela_105","Id":218775,"Name":"Angela_105","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e5da38b56dd22c6c0c0de356017b9ef","RawContent":"Thanks for this topic, exactly what I needed. The website is amazing, thanks!:)","Attachments":[],"Id":845610,"PostDate":1253048691,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for this topic, exactly what I needed. The website is amazing, thanks!<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i1002.photobucket.com\/albums\/af147\/CaribbeanLover2010\/img-239-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i1002.photobucket.com\/albums\/...\/img-239-1.jpg<\/a><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i1002.photobucket.com\/albums\/af147\/CaribbeanLover2010\/img-21-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i1002.photobucket.com\/albums\/...0\/img-21-1.jpg<\/a><br><span>Tracy and Mike<\/span><br><br><span>Married and in love all over again!!!!!!<\/span><br><span>Happily ever after...<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Tracyl_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1242925301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217721.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"caribbeanLover","Id":217721,"Name":"caribbeanLover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"805ba676965856b3cf33005266def5ba","RawContent":"This is the invite wording for the AHR. We sent them out about 5 weeks ago to give everyone plenty of notice.\n \n (our full names on top)\n \n On October 10th, 2009 we will be married in Ocho Rios, Jamaica.\n We invite you to join us upon return for a celebratory luncheon.\n \n (date, time, rsvp, ect)\n \n I made up this simple verse to convey the fact that it is in no way a fancy blown out reception, and that we will already be married by then.\n Not that this is important but I got the invites made up by Paperstyle.com, they have quite a few beach designs to pick from. I accidently had made a typo on the restaurant address and they reprinted my entire order, free of charge and rushed shipped it. I cannot say enough good things about this company.\n Someone should start a thread where we post pictures of the AHR invites.","Attachments":[],"Id":852094,"PostDate":1253394359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is the invite wording for the AHR. We sent them out about 5 weeks ago to give everyone plenty of notice.<br \/> <br \/> (our full names on top)<br \/> <br \/> On October 10th, 2009 we will be married in Ocho Rios, Jamaica.<br \/> We invite you to join us upon return for a celebratory luncheon.<br \/> <br \/> (date, time, rsvp, ect)<br \/> <br \/> I made up this simple verse to convey the fact that it is in no way a fancy blown out reception, and that we will already be married by then.<br \/> Not that this is important but I got the invites made up by Paperstyle.com, they have quite a few beach designs to pick from. I accidently had made a typo on the restaurant address and they reprinted my entire order, free of charge and rushed shipped it. I cannot say enough good things about this company.<br \/> Someone should start a thread where we post pictures of the AHR invites.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>10-10-09<\/span><br><span>Beaches Boscobel!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i798.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy268\/michi6114\/DSC_2290-Copy-1-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i798.photobucket.com\/albums\/y...0-Copy-1-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"michi6114@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1240857393,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217091.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"michelle6114","Id":217091,"Name":"michelle6114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ee01542d549c25d85cfb24dc99f1dfc","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;GracieBebe&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;You should try &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.verseit.com\"&gt;VerseIt.com&lt;\/a&gt;. It has a bunch of great wording for all types of invitations. We got our AHR wording from there.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks for the website! Definitely helpful","Attachments":[],"Id":852181,"PostDate":1253403658,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>GracieBebe<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">You should try <a href='http:\/\/www.verseit.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>VerseIt.com<\/a>. It has a bunch of great wording for all types of invitations. We got our AHR wording from there.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks for the website! Definitely helpful\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/sgRnm6.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/sgRnm6.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"teneil.rn@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250967365,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220835.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TeNeil","Id":220835,"Name":"TeNeil","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3e5496e46f09a8e90cf4d777fe9b93e","RawContent":"These are all good ideas. I haven&#039;t even begun thinking about our AHR lol..my friend who can&#039;t make it to our wedding wants to plan it","Attachments":[],"Id":854382,"PostDate":1253571356,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                These are all good ideas. I haven't even begun thinking about our AHR lol..my friend who can't make it to our wedding wants to plan it\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"flasong@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1233501621,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214512.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Flasong","Id":214512,"Name":"Flasong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38244,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4035131910affad24c07b8bc7ade72ed","RawContent":"We decided to have a fiesta themed AHR...so I printed a fun picture of us from the wedding and glued a picture on the front on the inviation, decorated with cactus and chili peppers along the borders, (which I had to glue on one by one, because I couldn&#039;t find anything I liked or wanted to pay for), and on the back it read: \n \n Tacos, Margaritas, That&#039;s HOT\n it&#039;s a Fiesta Celebration\n Lizeth &amp;amp; Alberto\n Tied the KNOT\n \n With all the details under that. I know, I know, it may be a bit cheesy, but it turned out really cute. The picture of us was of us him carrying me on the beach and we&#039;re both laughing.","Attachments":[],"Id":858607,"PostDate":1253804576,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We decided to have a fiesta themed AHR...so I printed a fun picture of us from the wedding and glued a picture on the front on the inviation, decorated with cactus and chili peppers along the borders, (which I had to glue on one by one, because I couldn't find anything I liked or wanted to pay for), and on the back it read: <br \/> <br \/> Tacos, Margaritas, That's HOT<br \/> it's a Fiesta Celebration<br \/> Lizeth & Alberto<br \/> Tied the KNOT<br \/> <br \/> With all the details under that. I know, I know, it may be a bit cheesy, but it turned out really cute. The picture of us was of us him carrying me on the beach and we're both laughing.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lizetholague@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1230938460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213514.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"zethers","Id":213514,"Name":"zethers","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":118,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
