KH,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I need a lesson in couponing from you.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What an amazing haul you have. You&#039;re guests are going to be thrilled.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I would love to see a template of your passport booklet when you are done. I had a similar hope of doing that, but am not sure how I want to organize it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n Congratulations on being done with your OOT bags and my best wishes for a wonderful wedding day!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1549602,"PostDate":1321976875,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> MJKH,<\/p> <p> I need a lesson in couponing from you.<\/p> <p> What an amazing haul you have. You're guests are going to be thrilled.<\/p> <p> I would love to see a template of your passport booklet when you are done. I had a similar hope of doing that, but am not sure how I want to organize it.<\/p> <p> <br \/> Congratulations on being done with your OOT bags and my best wishes for a wonderful wedding day!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sherio9090@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1302088303,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238586.bmp?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sherio9090","Id":238586,"Name":"Sherio9090","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ac3faa530b4a127cde1d6a1bf1f4e4c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; P.S. I also loved playing store when I was a kid &lt;span alt=\":D\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_7_1321991276841_151\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1549603,"PostDate":1321976919,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> P.S. I also loved playing store when I was a kid <span alt=\":D\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_7_1321991276841_151\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sherio9090@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1302088303,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238586.bmp?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sherio9090","Id":238586,"Name":"Sherio9090","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":